    <string name="app_two_facts_per_movement_not_one_number_wh_1e32c2a6">Two facts per movement, not one number: WHICH variation you do, and HOW MUCH of it. Every movement has a ladder of four to seven variations, and neighbouring rungs stand close enough together that the next one is never a leap. The dose is reps per set — or seconds for a hold — and it grows only to what you have already shown.</string>
